Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are khaman and dhokla the same? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And khandvi is different again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:07.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's spot the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Khaman is made from besan or chana dal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:13.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soda or fruit salt makes it rise fast:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,bright yellow and spongy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:18.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dhokla is made from a rice-and-dal batter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,left to ferment overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Paler in colour, with a slight tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:27.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Khandvi is besan with buttermilk or yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:29.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The batter is cooked, spread thin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:30.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,then rolled up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:35.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick test: bright yellow and spongy is khaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,pale and tangy is dhokla,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,little rolls are khandvi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:42.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Screenshot this slide,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:46.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and next time at the farsan shop, you'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which one is your favourite? Tell us in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo. Follow Otlo.
